DeepFilterNet3 (ONNX export) - noise suppression model used by KlipFox "AI" mode.
Files: enc.onnx, erb_dec.onnx, df_dec.onnx (about 8.6 MB in total).
Source: https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet  (models/DeepFilterNet3_onnx.tar.gz)
Author: Hendrik Schroeter. License: MIT or Apache-2.0 (your choice) - see the licence files in that repository.
The app downloads these three files once, stores them in Cache Storage (cache "klipfox-lib") and runs them locally.
